# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Canonicalize the apex domain onto www. Requires BOTH veloworkspaces.com and
# www.veloworkspaces.com to be added as custom domains on this Pages project
# (Cloudflare Pages > your project > Custom domains) — otherwise the apex
# domain never reaches this project for the redirect to fire.
https://veloworkspaces.com/*  https://www.veloworkspaces.com/:splat  301!
